  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ElrondOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to MultiversX (formerly Elrond) -- adaptive state sharding blockchain achieving 15,000+ TPS with 6-second finality via Secure Proof of Stake. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and ESDT tokens. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Derive real MultiversX and Cardano keys; share Bech32 and SLIP-10 (9fa7d2f)\n- Prepare scoped MultiversX demo release excluding unverified TRON adapter (c81de60)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ElrondOASIS",
